 ],
 "notes": "Landscape-only pass (buildings/walls skipped). Views: Yandex z18 overview + z19 close views of the NW apartment yard, stadium, SW blocks, N strip and school. NW yard (x~190-238, y~305-357): open worn-asphalt courtyard between 5-storey blocks, traced as yard + 3 parking polygons only where cars stand (row along yard driveway, 3 cars in S part, 4 cars at W corner of block at ~(194,342)). Playground: real sand playground with red equipment at (242-261, 276-289); the model playground at ~(248,320) is under tree canopy with no equipment - not confirmed. Model playground at ~(240,445) N of the main road lies inside a walled bare-earth vacant/construction lot (traced as soil yard); a yellow frame structure at (233-240, 414-427) next to it is unclear (not traced as playground). Model playground at ~(255,160) (W of the red-roof building) is trees/building - not confirmed. Stadium: fenced artificial-turf mini-football pitch (356-402, 217-267) = sport/turf; open bare-dirt field N of it (345-413, 269-303) = soil yard with a worn E-W path joining both sidewalks; dirt running-track ring (U) around the pitch joins the paved school apron S of it; dirt path W of the stadium runs to the school forecourt. Gated cottage complex N of the main road: 5 cars in perpendicular bays at the gate (303-321, 400-407); its paved internal lane traced as footpath paving 3.5 m (joins the road-side path). Parking row W of the big building at x~168-174 continued from T_1_0 (141.5 -> 157.7). Inter-block yards in the SW are under dense canopy (lawn, not traced). No alleys missing from the model were found."
